# Hidden Lair: "{T}: Add {C}." and "{T}: Add {U} or {B}. Activate only if this land entered this turn or if you control a
# basic land." Played on turn 1 with no other land it entered this turn, so {U} or {B} is offered: Bot1 taps it for {B}.
# On Bot2's side nothing is affected (Bot2's Island is not Bot1's basic land).

[Bot1 Deck]
Hidden Lair
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Hidden Lair.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Hidden Lair.Activate(Ability: or; Color: Black)

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {B}
Bot1.Battlefield.Hidden Lair.Tapped = true
